<title>USA: HFS to hold 25 pct of Avis after IPO.</title>
<headline>HFS to hold 25 pct of Avis after IPO.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFS Inc said that after the initial public offering of its Avis Rent A Car Inc subsidiary, the public will own about 75 percent of the company, with HFS retaining a 25 percent interest.</p>
<p>HFS said that about $225 million of common stock is expected to be offered and that Avis will retain all proceeds from the offering.</p>
<p>Avis expects to use the proceeds to prepay outstanding indebtedness and for general corporate purposes, including possible acquisitions.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co Inc is the managing underwriter.</p>
</text>
